This directory contains various tools.

AM1 contains the am1 macro assembler.
Disassembler is the rim binary diassember, it is built during the install process automatically.
Docviewer reads and formats documentation tapes that generally show up as 'xxx.bin' but aren't executables.
Drumupdater contains drumupdater and drumlister, tools for copying executable rim tapes to the drum.
M1PP contains the macro_1 preprocessor, not maintained now.
MtoA contains the macro_1 to am1 converter.

Pdp1audio is also installed automatically and is a control app for the extened audio features.
